---
---
<section class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-am-dark via-am-dark to-am-blue/20 pt-24 pb-32">

  <!-- Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5 bg-grid-lg"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-3 h-3 bg-am-accent rounded-full blur-sm animate-pulse-dot"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-1/3 right-1/3 w-2 h-2 bg-am-yellow rounded-full blur-sm animate-pulse-dot" style="animation-delay:0.5s"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/3 left-1/2 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-am-blue-mid rounded-full blur-sm animate-pulse-dot" style="animation-delay:1s"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-am-accent/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-am-blue-mid/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

      <!-- Content -->
      <div>
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <div class="mb-6 reveal">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-am-blue/40 border border-am-accent/30 text-am-accent text-sm font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-am-accent rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
            El equipo detrás de la experiencia
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight reveal" data-delay="0.1">
          Diseñamos en <span class="text-am-accent">colaboración</span> para construir productos con sentido
        </h1>

        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 reveal" data-delay="0.2">
          En Areamovil entendemos el diseño como un trabajo compartido. Reunimos estrategia, gestión,
          experiencia de usuario e interfaz para transformar necesidades complejas en productos digitales
          más claros, funcionales y consistentes.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal" data-delay="0.3">
          <a href="#intro-equipo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-transparent border-2 border-am-accent
                   text-am-accent rounded-lg hover:bg-am-accent/10 transition-all duration-300 group">
            Conocer cómo trabajamos
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tags -->
        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center gap-6 flex-wrap reveal" data-delay="0.5">
          {[
            { label: 'Estrategia',    color: '#0A84FF' },
            { label: 'Gestión',       color: '#014D94' },
            { label: 'UX/UI',         color: '#0A84FF' },
            { label: 'Colaboración',  color: '#FFC501' },
          ].map((tag, i) => (
            <>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-400 text-sm">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style={`background:${tag.color}`}></div>
                <span>{tag.label}</span>
              </div>
              {i < 3 && <div class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-am-accent/50 to-transparent hidden sm:block"></div>}
            </>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="relative hidden lg:block reveal-right" data-delay="0.4">
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-am-accent/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-am-blue/30 to-am-dark/50 backdrop-blur-sm p-2">
          <img
            src="/assets/18055adf04ea951de99a60e55ddd85d86417c8a8.png"
            alt="Trabajo colaborativo en diseño"
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 bg-am-accent/20 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -left-4 w-32 h-32 bg-am-yellow/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

        <!-- Floating card -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-am-dark border border-am-accent/40 rounded-xl px-6 py-4 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(10,132,255,0.2)] animate-float">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-am-yellow rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
            <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm">Equipo conectado</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
